{% set issue_dt = frappe.utils.getdate(doc.issue_date) %}
{% set day_num = issue_dt.day %}
{% if 11 <= (day_num % 100) <= 13 %}{% set suffix = 'th' %}{% else %}{% set suffix = {1: 'st', 2: 'nd', 3: 'rd'}.get(day_num % 10, 'th') %}{% endif %}
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Questrial&family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&display=swap');
  @page {
    size: A4 portrait;
    margin: 18mm 20mm 18mm 20mm;
  }
  .xav-latex-wrapper {
    font-family: 'TeX Gyre Adventor', 'Questrial', 'Century Gothic', 'Inter', Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 9.5pt;
    line-height: 1.38;
    color: #000000;
  }
  .xav-letterhead {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .xav-lh-company {
    color: rgb(0, 102, 204);
    font-size: 16pt;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    margin: 0 0 4px 0;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .xav-lh-cin {
    font-size: 9.5pt;
    margin: 0 0 2px 0;
    color: #000000;
  }
  .xav-lh-addr {
    font-size: 8.5pt;
    margin: 0 0 6px 0;
    color: #222222;
  }
  .xav-hrule {
    border: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #000000;
    margin: 4px 0 12px 0;
  }
  .xav-meta-table {
    width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-size: 9.2pt;
  }
  .xav-meta-table td {
    vertical-align: top;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .xav-sec {
    margin-bottom: 7px;
    text-align: justify;
  }
  .xav-sec-heading {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: rgb(0, 102, 204);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 9.3pt;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .xav-ul {
    margin: 2px 0 4px 18px;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .xav-ul li {
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .xav-director-block {
    margin-top: 14px;
    page-break-inside: avoid;
    font-size: 9.5pt;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }
  .xav-page-footer {
    margin-top: 12px;
    padding-top: 4px;
    border-top: 0.5px solid #888888;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 7.8pt;
    color: #444444;
  }
  .page-break {
    page-break-before: always;
  }
</style>

<div class="xav-latex-wrapper">
  <!-- ================= PAGE 1: OFFICIAL OFFER LETTER ================= -->
  <div class="xav-letterhead">
    <div class="xav-lh-company">XAVIRGIN (OPC) PRIVATE LIMITED</div>
    <div class="xav-lh-cin"><strong>CIN:</strong> U62090KL2025OPC098558</div>
    <div class="xav-lh-addr">8/372, Ground Floor, Valiyaparambil, Edathala, Aluva, Ernakulam, Kerala - 683561</div>
    <hr class="xav-hrule"/>
  </div>

  <table class="xav-meta-table">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 60%;">
        <strong>To,</strong><br/>
        <strong>{{ doc.candidate_name }}</strong><br/>
        {% if doc.candidate_address %}{{ doc.candidate_address }}<br/>{% endif %}
        <strong>Email:</strong> {{ doc.candidate_email }}{% if doc.candidate_phone %} | <strong>Phone:</strong> {{ doc.candidate_phone }}{% endif %}
      </td>
      <td style="width: 40%; text-align: right;">
        <strong>Offer Ref:</strong> {{ doc.name }} (v{{ doc.offer_version }})<br/>
        <strong>Issue Date:</strong> {{ frappe.utils.formatdate(doc.issue_date, "dd-MM-yyyy") }}<br/>
        <strong>Acceptance Deadline:</strong> {{ frappe.utils.formatdate(doc.acceptance_deadline, "dd-MM-yyyy") }}
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p style="margin: 6px 0;"><strong>Sub: Official Internship Offer &amp; Zero Energy Protocol Governance — {{ doc.designation }}</strong></p>

  <p style="margin: 4px 0 6px 0; text-align: justify;">
    Dear <strong>{{ doc.candidate_name }}</strong>,<br/>
    We are pleased to offer you an educational remote internship opportunity with <strong>XAVIRGIN (OPC) PRIVATE LIMITED</strong> (the "Company"). Xavirgin operates under a strict <strong>Zero Energy Protocol</strong> focused on rapid execution, real engineering output, and zero operational waste.
  </p>

  <div class="xav-sec">
    <span class="xav-sec-heading">1. Role, Track &amp; Zero Energy Execution Directive</span>
    <strong>Position:</strong> {{ doc.designation }} ({{ doc.skill_area }}) | <strong>Category:</strong> {{ doc.employment_type or 'Unpaid, 90-Day Remote Engineering Residency' }}.<br/>
    You will build and maintain Xavirgin's in-house systems, ERP modules, and digital products. Under the Zero Energy Protocol, merely logging attendance, attending calls, or creating unverified tasks does not count as productivity—every working session must produce measurable, verifiable output (commits, pull requests, UI assets, or verified test cases).
  </div>

  <div class="xav-sec">
    <span class="xav-sec-heading">2. 90 Active Working Days &amp; Dynamic End-Date Extension Policy</span>
    <strong>Start Date:</strong> {{ frappe.utils.formatdate(doc.start_date, "dd-MM-yyyy") }} | <strong>Initial Target End Date (Excl. Sundays):</strong> {{ frappe.utils.formatdate(doc.end_date, "dd-MM-yyyy") }}.<br/>
    <strong>Dynamic Attendance Adjustment:</strong> Your target completion requires <strong>{{ doc.active_working_days_required or 90 }} verified active working days</strong> (excluding Sundays). <strong>Please note that the End Date mentioned above is provisional and will automatically extend based on your actual attendance and leaves.</strong> Any approved leave, missed day, or day with less than 4.0 logged working hours will automatically push your Effective End Date forward day-for-day until {{ doc.active_working_days_required or 90 }} full active days are completed. The first <strong>{{ doc.initial_evaluation_days or 15 }} days</strong> serve as a strict probation period.
  </div>

  <div class="xav-sec">
    <span class="xav-sec-heading">3. Daily 4-Hour Work Requirement &amp; Mandatory 8:00 PM Sync</span>
    <ul class="xav-ul">
      <li><strong>Minimum Daily Commitment:</strong> You must complete a minimum of <strong>4.0 verified hours per day</strong> (6 days a week, Monday–Saturday; Sunday Off) logged via the Xavirgin OS Attendance &amp; Daily POA tracker.</li>
      <li><strong>Mandatory Daily 8:00 PM IST Meeting:</strong> Attendance at the daily engineering sync at <strong>8:00 PM IST</strong> is compulsory. <em>Note: Daily meeting timings may vary based on project sprints, deployment schedules, or management directives.</em></li>
      <li><strong>Immediate Removal for Non-Compliance:</strong> Unexcused absences from the daily 8:00 PM sync, failure to file Daily POAs, inactivity, or violation of Xavirgin OS rules will result in <strong>immediate termination and removal</strong> from the cohort without prior notice.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="xav-sec">
    <span class="xav-sec-heading">4. Certification, LOR &amp; Worldwide Shipping Policy</span>
    Certificates and Letters of Recommendation (LOR) are unlocked <strong>strictly after completing all {{ doc.active_working_days_required or 90 }} active working days</strong>:
    <ul class="xav-ul">
      <li><strong>Digital Copy (Free):</strong> A digitally signed PDF Completion Certificate and LOR will be sent to your registered email completely <strong>free of cost</strong>.</li>
      <li><strong>Original Hardcopy Office Pickup (Free):</strong> You may collect the original physical hardcopy certificate (bearing the official company seal and Managing Director's wet signature) directly from our registered office in Aluva, Kerala, <strong>free of cost</strong>.</li>
      <li><strong>Domestic &amp; Worldwide Shipping (Candidate Bears Charge):</strong> If you require the original physical certificate shipped to your domestic or international address, <strong>you must bear all shipping, packaging, and courier charges</strong> or arrange your own courier pickup.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="xav-sec">
    <span class="xav-sec-heading">5. Unpaid Status, IP Ownership &amp; Mandatory Compliance</span>
    This residency is an unpaid educational engagement and does not constitute employment or guarantee job placement. All source code, designs, credentials, and repositories touched during your tenure are the exclusive intellectual property of Xavirgin (OPC) Private Limited. You must strictly comply with all policies at <strong>xavirgin.com/workplace-policy</strong> and <strong>xavirgin.com/terms-and-conditions</strong>.
  </div>

  <div class="xav-sec">
    <span class="xav-sec-heading">6. Acceptance Deadline</span>
    Please sign and upload/return a scanned copy of this Offer Letter &amp; NDA along with valid government ID proof on or before <strong>{{ frappe.utils.formatdate(doc.acceptance_deadline, "dd-MM-yyyy") }}</strong>, failing which this offer shall stand automatically revoked.
  </div>

  <table style="width: 100%; margin-top: 10px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%; vertical-align: top;">
        <div class="xav-director-block">
          Yours faithfully,<br/>
          <strong>For XAVIRGIN (OPC) PRIVATE LIMITED,</strong><br/><br/><br/>
          <strong>Savio Babu</strong><br/>
          Managing Director<br/>
          DIN: 11384925<br/>
          <strong>Place:</strong> Ernakulam | <strong>Date:</strong> {{ frappe.utils.formatdate(doc.issue_date, "dd-MM-yyyy") }}
        </div>
      </td>
      <td style="width: 50%; vertical-align: top; border-left: 1px dashed #999; padding-left: 12px; font-size: 8.8pt;">
        <strong>Candidate Acceptance &amp; Acknowledgment:</strong><br/>
        I, <strong>{{ doc.candidate_name }}</strong>, accept this offer and agree to abide by the 90-day dynamic attendance extension rule, daily 4-hour work log, mandatory 8:00 PM sync, immediate removal clause for rule violations, and certificate shipping terms.<br/><br/><br/>
        ______________________________________<br/>
        <strong>Signature: {{ doc.candidate_name }}</strong> | <strong>Date:</strong> ____________
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="xav-page-footer">
    XAVIRGIN (OPC) PRIVATE LIMITED | CIN: U62090KL2025OPC098558 | Offer Ref: {{ doc.name }} | Page 1 of 2
  </div>

  <!-- ================= PAGE 2: NON-DISCLOSURE AGREEMENT ================= -->
  <div class="page-break"></div>

  <div class="xav-letterhead">
    <div class="xav-lh-company">XAVIRGIN (OPC) PRIVATE LIMITED</div>
    <div class="xav-lh-cin"><strong>CIN:</strong> U62090KL2025OPC098558</div>
    <div class="xav-lh-addr">8/372, Ground Floor, Valiyaparambil, Edathala, Aluva, Ernakulam, Kerala - 683561</div>
    <hr class="xav-hrule"/>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin: 18px 0;">
    <strong style="font-size: 12.5pt; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: underline;">NON-DISCLOSURE &amp; INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY AGREEMENT</strong>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.55; text-align: justify;">
    This Non-Disclosure Agreement (the "Agreement") is entered into on this <strong>{{ day_num }}{{ suffix }}</strong> day of <strong>{{ issue_dt.strftime('%B %Y') }}</strong>, by and between:
  </p>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.55; text-align: justify;">
    <strong>XAVIRGIN (OPC) PRIVATE LIMITED</strong> (CIN: U62090KL2025OPC098558), having its registered office at 8/372, Ground Floor, Valiyaparambil, Edathala, Aluva, Ernakulam, Kerala - 683561, India (hereinafter referred to as the <strong>"Company"</strong>);
  </p>

  <p style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold; margin: 8px 0;">AND</p>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.55; text-align: justify;">
    <strong>{{ doc.candidate_name }}</strong>{% if doc.candidate_address %}, residing at {{ doc.candidate_address }}{% endif %} (Email: {{ doc.candidate_email }}) (hereinafter referred to as the <strong>"Recipient"</strong>).
  </p>

  <div style="margin-top: 16px; font-size: 9.8pt; line-height: 1.55; text-align: justify;">
    <p><strong>1. Definition of Confidential Information:</strong> "Confidential Information" includes all non-public source code, ERPNext/Frappe custom modules, database schemas, API keys, DMS passwords, product architectures (including Xavirgin OS and Xoly), internal communications, and business methodologies operating under the Zero Energy Protocol.</p>

    <p><strong>2. Strict Non-Disclosure &amp; Repository Security:</strong> The Recipient shall hold all Confidential Information in strict confidence. The Recipient is strictly prohibited from pushing Company code to personal public GitHub/GitLab repositories, sharing internal screenshots, or reusing proprietary logic outside the Company without prior written authorization from the Managing Director.</p>

    <p><strong>3. Assignment of Intellectual Property:</strong> All source code, pull requests, UI/UX Figma components, documentation, and algorithms created by the Recipient during the internship shall be considered "work made for hire" and shall vest exclusively in <strong>XAVIRGIN (OPC) PRIVATE LIMITED</strong>.</p>

    <p><strong>4. Immediate Revocation &amp; Legal Remedies:</strong> Any breach of this Agreement or failure to adhere to organizational directives shall result in immediate revocation of access, forfeiture of internship certification, and legal recourse under the Indian Contract Act, 1872 and Information Technology Act, 2000.</p>

    <p><strong>5. Governing Law &amp; Jurisdiction:</strong> This Agreement shall be governed by the laws of India. The courts at <strong>Ernakulam, Kerala</strong> shall have exclusive jurisdiction over all disputes arising out of this Agreement.</p>
  </div>

  <table style="width: 100%; margin-top: 45px; font-size: 10pt;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%; vertical-align: top;">
        <strong>For XAVIRGIN (OPC) PRIVATE LIMITED,</strong><br/><br/><br/><br/>
        <strong>Savio Babu</strong><br/>
        Managing Director<br/>
        DIN: 11384925<br/><br/>
        <strong>Place:</strong> Ernakulam<br/>
        <strong>Date:</strong> {{ frappe.utils.formatdate(doc.issue_date, "dd-MM-yyyy") }}
      </td>
      <td style="width: 50%; vertical-align: top;">
        <strong>Agreed &amp; Accepted by Recipient:</strong><br/><br/><br/><br/>
        ______________________________________<br/>
        <strong>{{ doc.candidate_name }}</strong><br/>
        Position: {{ doc.designation }}<br/><br/>
        <strong>Place:</strong> ________________________<br/>
        <strong>Date:</strong> ________________________
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="xav-page-footer" style="margin-top: 55px;">
    XAVIRGIN (OPC) PRIVATE LIMITED | CIN: U62090KL2025OPC098558 | Offer Ref: {{ doc.name }} | Page 2 of 2
  </div>
</div>
